@baseUrl = http://localhost:7109
@studentToken = replace-with-a-student-access-token

# Production deployments must persist/share the ASP.NET Core Data Protection key ring.
# Phase 4 must Base64Url-decode and unprotect with purpose InternLink.StudentInternshipAcceptance.v1.

### Student dashboard progress and semester-configured deadlines
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/dashboard-progress
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Issue a protected, time-limited introduction acceptance link
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/student/introduction-letter
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### Load field policies for the authenticated student's role
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/system/field-policies/STUDENT_WEEKLY_REPORT?currentUserRole=true
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}
